WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.925 --> 00:00:04.759
I think it’s important for entrepreneurs

00:00:05.032 --> 00:00:06.398
to thank the people in their lives

00:00:06.531 --> 00:00:08.146
who are helping make an impact

00:00:08.389 --> 00:00:10.230
who are helping them grow their business

00:00:10.291 --> 00:00:12.305
because it’s hard doing everything yourself.

00:00:12.587 --> 00:00:14.499
So today I want to thank Dan Weiniger

00:00:14.712 --> 00:00:17.150
and Dan is a… (how did I meet Dan?)

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.635
Dan – I met through Facebook.

00:00:18.857 --> 00:00:20.222
And he’s was fan of my stuff

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.719
and liked the content that I was creating

00:00:23.108 --> 00:00:25.042
and one day, you know, he reached out to me

00:00:25.239 --> 00:00:26.661
and asked me to check out his video

00:00:26.823 --> 00:00:28.162
and if I had any feedback for him.

00:00:28.499 --> 00:00:29.291
And I gave him some thoughts

00:00:29.583 --> 00:00:31.356
and told him a few ways to improve it

00:00:31.679 --> 00:00:34.475
and he took that and went right to work

00:00:34.715 --> 00:00:35.716
and started making them better.

00:00:36.539 --> 00:00:38.070
And he kept being a fan

00:00:38.266 --> 00:00:40.267
he kept looking at the content I was putting out

00:00:40.495 --> 00:00:43.527
and said, “Evan, I’d like you to come

00:00:43.755 --> 00:00:46.776
and potentially speak at our company’s event

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:47.902
our annual retreat”

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.827
for all the franchisees that he’s a part of.

00:00:50.295 --> 00:00:51.556
And he connected me with the founder

00:00:51.827 --> 00:00:52.972
and we had a great session

00:00:53.235 --> 00:00:54.432
and then he invited me to come down

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:56.367
and I just came back from Orlando

00:00:56.561 --> 00:00:57.725
and I met Dan, I met the team

00:00:57.952 --> 00:00:59.079
and it was a great experience.

00:00:59.451 --> 00:01:00.375
And what I love about Dan

00:01:00.906 --> 00:01:04.054
is that he’s constantly trying to reach out to people

00:01:04.261 --> 00:01:05.721
to find out how he can help them.

00:01:06.021 --> 00:01:07.915
He’s not just selling his services, right

00:01:08.155 --> 00:01:09.869
he’s not contacting me and saying, “Hey Evan

00:01:10.032 --> 00:01:12.467
will you buy my video services?” right.

00:01:12.998 --> 00:01:14.584
He’s looking for ways to help.

00:01:15.715 --> 00:01:18.247
So he started just by being a fan

00:01:18.633 --> 00:01:19.635
and sharing some of my stuff

00:01:19.874 --> 00:01:21.507
and of course, that helps me, right

00:01:21.768 --> 00:01:23.798
and if he’s telling me that he likes some of the stuff I’m creating

00:01:24.027 --> 00:01:26.559
and which one it is, that helps me gauge, you know

00:01:26.755 --> 00:01:27.621
what’s working and what isn’t

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:29.515
and it make me feel good too to hear from fans.

00:01:30.015 --> 00:01:31.644
And then he’s looking for ways

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:34.228
that he can help his fellow franchisees, right.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:36.784
So he loved the content I was creating

00:01:36.944 --> 00:01:37.846
the videos I was putting out

00:01:38.038 --> 00:01:40.315
and thought that other people could benefit from it as well

00:01:40.575 --> 00:01:42.367
and beyond just sharing the links of the videos

00:01:42.931 --> 00:01:45.387
to have me come and speak at their event

00:01:45.595 --> 00:01:47.308
and connect with people one on one.

00:01:47.855 --> 00:01:50.003
And he did that because he genuinely wanted

00:01:50.198 --> 00:01:52.294
his other franchisees to be better.

00:01:52.731 --> 00:01:55.380
And Dan makes a habit of trying to connect people

00:01:55.638 --> 00:01:57.239
even if it has nothing to do with his business

00:01:58.043 --> 00:02:00.920
just trying to connect people because he realizes

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:02.648
first that it makes him feel good

00:02:03.246 --> 00:02:05.071
right, it makes the other person feel good

00:02:05.698 --> 00:02:07.475
and then it also helps your business.

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:09.457
If you’re spending your time helping people

00:02:09.495 --> 00:02:10.760
you’re going to stay top of mind

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:11.637
and they’re going to look for ways

00:02:11.637 --> 00:02:12.597
to help you out as well.

00:02:13.141 --> 00:02:14.837
So Dan, thank you so much.

00:02:15.112 --> 00:02:15.903
Thank you for being a fan

00:02:16.311 --> 00:02:17.694
thank you for being a friend

00:02:17.838 --> 00:02:19.492
thank you for picking me up from the airport

00:02:20.214 --> 00:02:21.988
thank you for recommending me to the event.

00:02:22.185 --> 00:02:23.182
I had a blast meeting you.

00:02:23.539 --> 00:02:25.300
And for those of you watching

00:02:25.815 --> 00:02:29.060
I hope you’ll take some time this week to thank somebody

00:02:29.275 --> 00:02:31.212
who’s had an impact in your business somehow

00:02:31.921 --> 00:02:33.776
and make them feel special.

00:02:34.212 --> 00:02:35.097
Believe.

00:02:35.502 --> 00:02:36.065
For those of you watching

00:02:36.297 --> 00:02:36.793
you liked the video

00:02:36.989 --> 00:02:39.315
consider supporting me by clicking the link in the description.

00:02:39.609 --> 00:02:40.607
Leave a comment.

00:02:40.867 --> 00:02:41.468
Let me know what you think

00:02:41.707 --> 00:02:43.531
and click on my face to subscribe to the channel.

00:02:43.727 --> 00:02:45.677
Thank you so much, I’ll see you soon.

